# Skip Alpine/musl variants of optional native binaries when installing
# locally on a glibc system (devcontainer = Debian, host laptops are
# usually macOS/Debian/Fedora — all glibc).
#
# Saves ~140 MiB by not pulling @next/swc-linux-x64-musl, which is only
# needed inside the production Docker build (Alpine), and that container
# does its own `npm ci` against its own node_modules.
#
# If you actually run on Alpine locally, comment this out.
libc=glibc
